---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms" description="Basic visit and stay guidelines for Babaji Ashram.">
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">legal information</p>
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <div class="legal-shell">
        <p>
          The Ashram is a place for practice, silence, and shared daily life. If you plan to visit,
          please contact us in advance so we can confirm timing, the purpose of the stay, and the current rhythm of the Ashram.
        </p>
        <p>
          During a stay we ask visitors to respect the shared space, take part in simple daily tasks,
          and follow the schedule that is in place at that time.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you need details about accommodation, meals, or participation in events, the best approach is to discuss them before arrival.
          That keeps the visit calm and clear for everyone involved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 5rem 1.25rem 6rem;
  }

  .container {
    width: min(100%, 960px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .legal-shell {
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    background: rgba(255, 252, 247, 0.76);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -42px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .legal-shell p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
